{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"幂"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"幂, 余张量积"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 的对象 $X$, 以及"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $A$, <strong>幂</strong> $X^A$ (又记作 $[A,X]$) 给出自然同构\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-, X^A)\r\n\\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ani}}(A,\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,X)),\r\n$$\n也即两个函子</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X^{(-)}\\colon \\mathsf{Ani}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathcal C$</li>\n<li>$\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,X)\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Ani}$</li>\n</ul>\n<p>满足"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,X)^{\\mathrm{op}}\\dashv X^{(-)}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>当然, "},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实范畴"}},{"Plain":"的对象也有类似的幂的概念.</p>\n<p>幂又称余张量积 (cotensor), 对偶的概念是"},{"Local":{"url":"张量积","text":"张量积"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}